==========================

Triton
------

Project: Triton language and compiler
Upstream: https://github.com/triton-lang/triton
License: MIT

Triton may be used by an optional, pinned build-time toolchain to produce Community
Program Pack cubin artifacts. Triton, Python, PyTorch, and the Triton JIT/compiler are
not required or shipped as production Imparo runtime dependencies by this integration.
Redistributed Triton-derived material must retain the notices required by its MIT
license and exact locked source/toolchain provenance.

