Frozen Marlin module
--------------------

The optional Windows SM86 W4A16 path embeds the fixed vLLM 0.28.0 Marlin
image from revision 2cf0a6915ce544dc493a0990f2ea38d81601128a, without an
arithmetic rebuild. Apache-2.0 license text and exact extraction provenance
are retained together in crates/imparo-cuda/native/sm86/w4a16_marlin/.
See SOURCE.md there for the selected image and its immutable SHA256.

